listing:   gemm_dbuf.cuh (via sgemm_dbuf.cu)
toolchain: Cuda compilation tools, release 12.0, V12.0.140
command:   for a in sm_80 sm_75; do nvcc -arch=$a -cubin sgemm_dbuf.cu -o .tmp_$a.cubin || exit 1; echo "--- $a, 64x64 double-buffered kernel"; cuobjdump -sass -fun _Z17sgemmDoubleBufferILi64ELi64ELi8ELi4ELi4EEvPKfS1_Pfiii .tmp_$a.cubin | grep -E '^[[:space:]]+/\*[0-9a-f]{4}\*/' | sed -E 's#^[[:space:]]+/\*([0-9a-f]+)\*/[[:space:]]+(.*[^[:space:]])[[:space:]]*;.*#\1  \2#' | grep -o -E '(LDGSTS[.A-Z0-9]*|LDGDEPBAR|DEPBAR[.A-Z0-9]*|LDG[.A-Z0-9]*|STS[.A-Z0-9]*|BAR\.SYNC)' | sort | uniq -c; done
date:      2026-10-10T00:40:29Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
hardware:  compiled only: no GPU is needed to read generated code
exit code: 0
